WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.940
Good Morning, John.

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:04.000
Actually, you know what, it's not a good morning. 
It's a bad morning,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.320
because I am freaking tired of getting 
dicked around by customer service.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.960
The customer service industry is, it seems, engaging in 
a practice that I will henceforth be calling an

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.180
Asshole Propagation Program.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:21.880
I am defining these APPs as any societal program that 
ignores kindness and openness and coolness,

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.840
and rewards general douchebaggery.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.560
As an example so you can better understand what an APP is

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.360
I am going to reenact a recent call that I had 
with a customer service agent of a company

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.040
that I give my business to that I will 
not mention the name of.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.620
APP Hank: Hi, this is Jeffrey from a big company's 
APP department.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.080
Hank: Hi, yeah, my name's Hank Green. 
My credit card was recently defrauded

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.480
and so I had to cancel my card and 
I didn't realize that it was the card that

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:48.680
I had listed for your company's service on automatic 
payment and  I just got a letter from you guys

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:53.680
saying that you were charging me an extra thirty bucks 
because, uh, the payment didn't go through,

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.480
but it was just 'cause my card was defrauded and
 I was too busy to try and find all of the places

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:02.440
where it was listed as the automatic payment option and

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.980
so I thought maybe that wasn't a necessary charge.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.660
APP Hank: Yeah, it's perfectly legal for us to do that.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:12.120
Hank: Well, yeah, I wasn't saying that 
it's not legal for you to do it,

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:16.940
I just thought that since none of the other half a 
dozen companies  that had that card listed as

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:22.700
an automatic payment option, didn't charge me 
anything, that it was maybe a little silly

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:24.300
for your company to charge me all that money.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.000
APP Hank: I apologize sir, but that's our policy.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.740
Hank: Um, yeah.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:32.920
But,  do you see where I'm coming from here?

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:36.360
Like, it's just, like, is your company going 
to charge me a bunch of money

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:41.720
every time they're legally allowed to do it, even if, you 
know, I'm already dealing with a bunch of crap?

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:46.220
APP Hank: Well I'm sorry sir but there's nothing I 
can do for you. Um, that's just our policy.

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:47.520
That's, that's how we do it.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:51.160
And now, my friends, the moment you have been 
waiting for: the moment when I give in to the APP.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:51.980
I am not proud.

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:53.040
I'm ashamed.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.200
But I did.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.560
Hank: This is bull-(beep)!

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:59.260
First I have to deal with all the bullcrap because 
I got my credit card defrauded

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.420
and that guy was stealing money from me, 
and now your company decides

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.780
that they can steal more money from me because 
I already got money stolen from me!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.480
This is not okay!

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:09.600
What you're doing is just making me as like an -
(beep)-hole and say lots of curse words like

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:13.900
bull-(beep) and (beep)-hole so that you can have 
a justification for going to your manager

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.180
and asking me for my money back!

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:16.340
So just go do it!

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:23.060
Go ask for me, my, my, freaking money back and I will 
stop yelling at you because I am not a mean guy!

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.420
I am a nice guy and I am tired of this!

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:28.800
I hate that you made me yell at you! 
Go talk to your manager!

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:32.320
APP Hank: Sir, will you please hold?
Hank: Yes! I will hold!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:39.120
APP Hank: Sir, we've gone ahead and credited 
the thirty dollars back to your account.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.000
Is there anything else I can do for you today?

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.760
Hank: No! That is all you can do for me! 
Thank you. Bye.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.880
So I just wanna send out a message to all of the 
Asshole Propagation Programs in the world.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.740
We've got our eye on you.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.420
What you're doing might decrease your costs for now,

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:03.620
but in the long run, all you are doing is creating 
more assholes, and it's not just customer service,

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:09.480
it's every societal program that punishes 
kindness and rewards douchebaggery.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.720
All of you! It needs to STOP.

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:14.660
Do not give in! 
End the APPs!

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.540
Viva la revolution!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.120
I just wanted to show you that this is- 
I don't have one of these.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:28.900
It's just a flash drive with duct tape on it.
And that part's been in my ear.

